s it worked, sitting at the right crossroads and running it well enough that the world kept showing up. Then the trade routes shifted, the storms got worse, the pirates got organised, and the world stopped showing up. What followed was not a collapse so much as an abandonment. The people who could leave, left. What remained were the people who couldn't, a port that still runs because old habits die hard, and the creeping certainty that somewhere out there, someone's finger is getting closer to a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Shiokmenistan. One Singapore teetering on the edge, a hundred years from now. The nukes are warming up. What's left are the humans, the heat, the harbour... and durians as legal tender. Things are about to get a lot worse. Might as well get a few rounds in first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854200/extras/b743d571c6ea645e636982a3591479c1.poster.avif?t=1784635950\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854200/extras/b743d571c6ea645e636982a3591479c1.webm?t=1784635950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854200/extras/b743d571c6ea645e636982a3591479c1.mp4?t=1784635950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854200/extras/ebe79e95138812033ab1a5b5af59c85e.poster.avif?t=1784635950\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854200/extras/ebe79e95138812033ab1a5b5af59c85e.webm?t=1784635950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src